  "description": "Guide Heo Yoon-Jae thought he was done with the field after losing his esper to a brutal rampage, but fate seems to have other plans. On a trip to the Guiding Center for a one-day commission, Yoon-Jae finds himself faced with Woo Sang-Hyuk, an A-rank esper with a god complex and a reputation for blowing through guides like tissues. But Yoon-Jae isn't just any old guide, and he refuses to let an uppity young esper call the shots. Once Sang-Hyuk gets a taste of real guiding, he'll be putty in the palm of Yoon-Jae's hand. Or so he hopes, anyway.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
